\par \tab Finally, credit must also be shared with anyone who has ever asked a question, offered a suggestion, written an article, or made a comment about the AD&D game.
\par \tab This is a derivative work based on the original Advanced Dungeons & Dragons }{\i\fs24 Player's Handbook}{\fs24  and }{\i\fs24 Dungeon Master}{\i\fs24\up6 \'ae}{\i\fs24  Guide}{\fs24  by Gary Gygax and }{\i\fs24 Unearthed Arcana}{\fs24 
