\par The ranger is a hunter and woodsman who lives by not only his sword, but also hi
s wits. Robin Hood, Orion, Jack the giant killer, and the huntresses of Diana are examples of rangers from history and legend. The abilities of the ranger make him particularly good at tracking, woodcraft, and spying.
