\par 
\par }{\b\fs36\cf12 Light 
\par }{\fs24 Most characters cannot see much without light. Some night conditions (those for the outdoors) are given in Table 62. But all of these assume some small amount of light. In 
totally lightless conditions, normal vision is impossible, unless a source of light is carried by the party.
\par \tab Light sources vary in the area they affect. Table 63 gives the radius of light and burning time for the most common types of light sources.
