\par }\pard \nowidctlpar\tx-720\tx240\tx480\adjustright {\fs24 
\par \tab This spell is used solely against people or creatures who use magic spells. The }{\i\fs24 feeblemind}{\fs24  causes the subject's intellect to degenerate to that of a moronic child. The subject remains in this state until a }{\i\fs24 heal}{\fs24  or 
}{\i\fs24 wish}{\fs24  spell is used to cancel the effects. Magic-using beings are very vulnerable to this spell; thus, their saving throws are made with the following adjustments:
\par 
\par }\pard \keep\nowidctlpar\tx-720\tx2880\tx3780\adjustright {\b\fs24 Spell Use of Target\tab Saving Throw Adjustment}{\fs24 
