\par \tab The }{\i\fs24 glassteel}{\fs24  spell turns normal, nonmagical crystal or glass
 into a transparent substance that has the tensile strength and unbreakability of actual steel. Only a relatively small volume of material can be affected (a maximum weight of 10 pounds per level of experience of the spellcaster), and it must form one who
le object. The Armor Class of the substance is 1.
\par \tab The material components of this spell are a small piece of glass and a small piece of steel.
