\par }\pard \nowidctlpar\tx-720\tx240\tx480\adjustright {\fs24 
\par \tab When the very powerful }{\i\fs24 mind blank}{\fs24  spell is cast, the creature is totally protected from all devices and spells that detect, influence, or read emotions or thoughts. This protects against }{\i\fs24 
augury, charm, command, confusion, divination, empathy}{\fs24  (all forms), }{\i\fs24 ESP, fear, feeblemind, mass suggestion, phantasmal killer, possession, rulership, soul trapping, suggestion,}{\fs24  and }{\i\fs24 telepathy.}{\fs24  
Cloaking protection also extends to the prevention of discovery or information gathering by }{\i\fs24 crystal balls}{\fs24  or other scrying devices, }{\i\fs24 clairaudience, clairvoyance, communing, contacting other planes,}{\fs24 
 or wish-related methods (}{\i\fs24 wish}{\fs24  or }{\i\fs24 limited wish}{\fs24 ). Of course, exceedingly powerful deities can penetrate the spell's barrier.
\par 
