\par \tab This spell is much like the 3rd-level spell }{\i\fs24 monster summoning I}{\fs24 
, except that it summons 1d3 6th-level monsters. These monsters appear in 1d3 rounds within the spell's area of effect and attack the caster's opponents, until either he commands them to cease,
 the spell duration expires, or the monsters are slain. These creatures do not check morale, and they vanish when slain. If no opponent exists to fight, summoned monsters can, if the wizard can communicate with them, and if they are physically capable, pe
rform other services for the summoning wizard.
\par \tab The material components of this spell are a tiny bag and a small (not necessarily lit) candle.
